Apply privileged GPU/CPU profile settings

Usage:
  spela apply-profile [flags]

Flags:
      --cpu-governor string     CPU frequency governor
      --cpu-smt string          CPU SMT control (on/off)
      --gpu-clock-offset int    GPU graphics clock offset (MHz)
      --gpu-fan-speed int       GPU fan speed percentage (0=auto)
      --gpu-memory-offset int   GPU memory clock (MHz)
      --gpu-power-limit int     GPU power limit (watts)
  -h, --help                    help for apply-profile
      --reset                   Reset GPU clocks to default
